  g_bar(m/s^2)  dlog g_obs(E-L)  RAR slope  required M_gas/M* (differential)
   1.38e-15     +0.362        0.67      2.26
   2.44e-15     +0.441        0.69      2.03
   4.30e-15     +0.432        0.92      3.65
